            "title": "滬指開市升28點 深成指升254點",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">內地股市初段顯著向上，上證綜指以3,567點開市，升28點或0.82%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">深證成指開市報10,708點，更漲254點或2.43%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滬深300指數升47點或1.16%，開報4,004點；創業板指數開市報2,368點，升88點或3.88%。</p>\n</div>",
