        {
            "title": "港股開市︱恒指漲243點報22,627點 聯想高開逾10% 中際旭創、AI大模型雙雄齊漲約15%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">港股開市初段跟隨外圍顯著反彈，恒生指數開市報22,627點，升243點或1.09%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"巴士的報記者攝\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/09/20250917_FI_source-web_00388-1.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"巴士的報記者攝\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/09/20250917_FI_source-web_00388-1.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">巴士的報記者攝</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生科技指數開報3,579點，升71點或2.05%；國企指數以7,587點開市，升59點或0.8%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">重磅股普遍造好，阿里巴巴(09988)開報86.6元，升4.28%；騰訊(00700)開報352元，升2.33%。滙控(00005)開報131.6元，升1.54%；友邦(01299)開報75.05元，升1.42%。聯想(00992)再漲10.4%，以19.42元開市。</p>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：聯想官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20240507_FI_source-web_00992.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：聯想官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20240507_FI_source-web_00992.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：聯想官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">小米(01810)收市後公布業績，該股今早開報27.52元，暫時無升跌。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">非藍籌熱門科也升多跌少，中際旭創(03302)開報590.5元，升15%；智譜(02513)開報391元，升14.99%；MiniMax(00100)開報119.9元，漲14.96%。</p>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"中際旭創官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/07/03308-Web2.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"中際旭創官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/07/03308-Web2.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">中際旭創官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">今日登場的新股先通醫藥(09941)，則以49元開市，較上市價52元低5.77%。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17249591-%e6%b8%af%e8%82%a1%e9%96%8b%e5%b8%82%ef%b8%b1%e6%81%92%e6%8c%87%e6%bc%b2243%e9%bb%9e%e5%a0%b122627%e9%bb%9e-%e8%81%af%e6%83%b3%e9%ab%98%e9%96%8b%e9%80%be10-%e4%b8%ad%e9%9a%9b%e6%97%ad%e5%89%b5",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/HKSTOCK.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-24 09:29:40",
            "source": "bastillepost",
