        {
            "title": "台股初段收復四萬關暫暴漲9.14% 日韓股市升幅擴大",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">黃仁勳重返英偉達任CEO，刺激隔晚華爾街股市急飆，亞洲主要股市初段亦大幅回升，昨天已開始反彈的台股早市暫已再漲逾9%，收復四萬關。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"黃仁勳 (圖片來源：英偉達官網)\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/07/20250715_FI_source-web_Huang-1.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"黃仁勳 (圖片來源：英偉達官網)\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/07/20250715_FI_source-web_Huang-1.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">黃仁勳 (圖片來源：英偉達官網)</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">截至香港時間上午約9時12分，台灣加權指數升3,357點或9.12%，報40,169點。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">日韓股市升幅亦擴大，日經平均指數報漲2,702點或4.79%，報59,138點。南韓首爾綜合指數暫升331點或7.04%，報5,039點。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17249384-%e5%8f%b0%e8%82%a1%e5%88%9d%e6%ae%b5%e6%94%b6%e5%be%a9%e5%9b%9b%e8%90%ac%e9%97%9c%e6%9a%ab%e6%9a%b4%e6%bc%b29-14-%e6%97%a5%e9%9f%93%e8%82%a1%e5%b8%82%e5%8d%87%e5%b9%85%e6%93%b4%e5%a4%a7",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20230810_FI_source-web_TaiwanStock2-704.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-24 09:20:44",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "黑芝麻核心員工完成股份增持  代價5,300萬",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">黑芝麻智能(02533)公布，核心員工已完成增持股份計劃，總代價約5,300萬元。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：黑芝麻智能官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/10/20261015_FI_source-web_02533-3.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：黑芝麻智能官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/10/20261015_FI_source-web_02533-3.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：黑芝麻智能官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">公司10月中公布，核心員工計劃於2026年11月底之前，以自有資金於公開市場增持股份，總代價介乎4,000萬元至5,000萬元之間。董事會接獲核心員工通知，截至公告日期已完成增持股份計劃，</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17249385-%e9%bb%91%e8%8a%9d%e9%ba%bb%e6%a0%b8%e5%bf%83%e5%93%a1%e5%b7%a5%e5%ae%8c%e6%88%90%e8%82%a1%e4%bb%bd%e5%a2%9e%e6%8c%81-%e4%bb%a3%e5%83%b95300%e8%90%ac",
