            "pub_date": "2026-11-24 09:20:44",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "越秀地產實物分派越秀房託   每1000股派122個基金單位",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">越秀地產(00123)公布以實物分派方式，派付特別股息，每持1000股獲派越秀房地產投資信託基金(00405)122個基金單位。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"越秀地產官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/07/00123.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"越秀地產官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/07/00123.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">越秀地產官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">集團指，將分派越秀房產基金約4.91億個基金單位，佔基金單位總數約9%，而該集團目前持有約23.9億個基金單位，佔基金單位總數43.95%，分派後持股降至34.94%，越秀房產基金續為其聯營公司。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17249361-%e8%b6%8a%e7%a7%80%e5%9c%b0%e7%94%a2%e5%af%a6%e7%89%a9%e5%88%86%e6%b4%be%e8%b6%8a%e7%a7%80%e6%88%bf%e8%a8%97-%e6%af%8f1000%e8%82%a1%e6%b4%be122%e5%80%8b%e5%9f%ba%e9%87%91%e5%96%ae%e4%bd%8d",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20240520_FI_00123_YUEXIU_SOURCE-WEB_FB.png.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-24 09:09:53",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
